			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-4337596">
									

<p>Glad to see you posted this.</p>
<p>I've still got some gripes with the primary description and the overuse of &quot;they&quot;, and the escalation of conflict in the addendum still needs a climax before the show-down. I still can't quite get behind the &quot;House&quot; character, or &quot;Pluto&quot; for that matter.</p>
<p>But it's a fun read, and a very cute concept. I'd just like to have seen more grounded events and responses. Right now, it feels as though &quot;Vegas slipping into hell&quot; is happening in a bit of a vaccum. Sure, there's some lethargy, horned folks and general hedonism, but it doesn't seem all that&#8230; dangerous?</p>
<p>+1 still. Good work.</p>

